{
  "_comment": [
    "Extension and filename to icon mapping for the bundled fallback icon set.",
    "Icon names refer to files in `file/` — `rust` means `file/rust.svg`.",
    "This is the synchronous answer the file list uses so a row never blocks or",
    "flickers on an icon lookup. The OS providers (D-18) layer over it and win",
    "when they resolve, because they know about application bundles and custom",
    "folder icons that no static table can.",
    "Lookup order: exact filename, then extension, then kind default."
  ],

